   "en": [
    "Now called Converter: it also turns Word, PowerPoint, Excel, PDF, EPUB, and OpenDocument files into Markdown, with a folder of their images, using anydoc. Drop a document on the Conversions page, or select it in Finder and run Convert to Markdown."
   ],
